WEBVTT

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:02.112
Section 6.

00:00:02.062 --> 00:00:04.525
International Comparison.

00:00:04.525 --> 00:00:10.650
Canada ranks near the bottom among wealthy nations for access, timeliness, and equity.

00:00:10.650 --> 00:00:16.575
Canadians pay first-world prices for a system that delivers developing-world wait times.
